{
  "title": "API Ticket - Unified Observability & Business Dashboard",
  "uid": "api-ticket-unified-dashboard",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "10s",
  "tags": ["api-ticket", "observability", "metrics", "logs", "traces", "business"],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Executive Business Metrics",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Total Reservations Created",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "blue" },
              { "value": 1, "color": "green" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(ticket_reservation_total) or sum(ticket_reservation_created_total) or sum(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\".*/v1/reservations.*\", status=~\"2.*\"}) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Idempotent Replays Prevented",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "purple" },
              { "value": 1, "color": "green" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(ticket_idempotency_hit_total) or sum(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\".*/v1/reservations.*\", status=\"200\"}) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "HTTP Status Distribution (Business Volume)",
      "type": "piechart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Business Transactions Throughput (/min)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cpm" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "rate(ticket_reservation_total[1m]) * 60 or rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\".*/v1/reservations.*\", method=\"POST\"}[1m]) * 60"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Application Performance & Health",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "HTTP Request Rate (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "HTTP Latency Average (ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "Avg Latency (ms)",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval]))) * 1000"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "HTTP 5xx Error Rate (%)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "green" },
              { "value": 1, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 5, "color": "red" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\", status=~\"5.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval]))) * 100 or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "JVM Heap & Process CPU Usage (%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "JVM Heap %",
          "expr": "(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"} / jvm_memory_max_bytes{area=\"heap\"}) * 100"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "CPU Usage %",
          "expr": "process_cpu_usage * 100"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Centralized Application Logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Log Volume by Level (INFO, WARN, ERROR)",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (detected_level) (count_over_time({app=~\".*api-ticket.*\"}[$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Live Application Log Stream",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": {
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{app=~\".*api-ticket.*\"}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 400,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Distributed Tracing & Jaeger Exploration",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19 }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Jaeger Traces Exploration & Log Correlation Hub",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Rastreamento Distribuído (Jaeger & OpenTelemetry)\n\n- **[Abrir UI Nativa do Jaeger (Busca de Traces por Filtro)](http://localhost:16686/search?service=api-ticket)**\n- **[Abrir no Grafana Explore (Filtro por Jaeger Datasource)](http://localhost:3000/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22query%22:%22api-ticket%22,%22service%22:%22api-ticket%22%7D%5D)**\n- **[Abrir Dashboard de Tracing Dedicado](http://localhost:3000/d/api-ticket-jaeger-traces)**\n\n> **Link de Correlação**: No painel de logs ao vivo acima, clique no botão TraceID para saltar diretamente para a waterfall no Jaeger."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "HTTP Response Latency Timeline (ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "Avg Response Time (ms)",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval]))) * 1000"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
